---
import { getModule, includedModules, moduleRoute } from '../../data/modules';
import { sitePath } from '../../lib/paths';
const module = getModule('ship-operations');
const available = includedModules.some((entry) => entry.id === module.id);
---
<aside class="sim-panel" aria-labelledby="carrier-learning-title">
  <h2 id="carrier-learning-title">Naval Operations</h2>
  <p>For flight-deck procedures, launches and recoveries, see {available ? <a href={sitePath(moduleRoute(module))}>{module.title}</a> : <a href={sitePath('manual/naval-operations/')}>Naval Operations</a>}. The module states its own sources, scope and review status.</p>
</aside>
